      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Target Provider**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on an external NoSQL provider for the `upsert_document.py` file. The goal is to make the chosen provider an explicit dependency within the Python code, but I still need to decide on which provider to focus on first.\n\n\n**Selecting DynamoDB Implementation**\n\nI've decided to move forward with AWS DynamoDB as the NoSQL provider for the `upsert_document.py` script. The implementation details are beginning to coalesce. I'm focusing on leveraging `boto3`, the AWS SDK for Python, to handle the upsert operations. My code will feature a dedicated upsert function, designed to handle the document insertion/update using the `put_item` method, with the region determined by environment variables for adaptability and best practice. My next step will be creating and developing the `upsert_document.py` file with the specified components.\n\n\n",
